// - Display window: [[-50, -26.5], [50, 31.5, 0.5]]
// - Bezel relief:  [[-105.5/2, -65/2 + 1], [105.5/2, 65/2 + 1, 1]]
// - Bottom connector: [[0, -34.5], [12, -31.5]]
// Model is ONE connected solid.

